{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a worker receives a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% cut in wages, he may regain his original pay exactly by obtaining a raise of:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/3/773f784e3b53336baedbebae9556976cc86e05eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{20\\%}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{25\\%}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 22\\frac{1}{2}\\text{\\%}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\textdollar{20}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\textdollar{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"463\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the worker receives a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% cut in wages, his present wage would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd03d5b164ae8b40db27a6f8ddb20d9d43f95fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the original wage before the cut. To regain his original pay he would have to obtain a raise of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c81486a525ba08192aab8546dbe9a32bdbe0c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\div$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd03d5b164ae8b40db27a6f8ddb20d9d43f95fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the worker would have to get a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/7107389da20c16710bed89a8692658d2519699eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{{\\bf(B)} 25\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"76\" height=\"28\" /> raise to acquire his original pay.\n</p><p>Solution by awesomechoco\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Pr